---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../content/site.ts';
---

<Layout
  title={`Samples & Pricing — ${site.writer.name}, Commissioned Fiction Writer`}
  description="Browse recent commissioned work and the current rate card for short flash pieces, mid-length stories, and long-form fiction written to order by Everayy."
>
  <main class="page">
    <a href="/" class="back-link" aria-label="Back to home">← Back</a>
    <header class="page-header">
      <h1 transition:name="page-title">Samples &amp; Pricing</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        A small selection of recent works paired with the rates I'm currently
        accepting. I charge $2 per 100 words, though prices may vary according
        to content.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="samples" aria-labelledby="samples-heading">
      <h2 id="samples-heading">Samples</h2>

      <article class="sample">
        <header class="sample-header">
          <h3>Frostbite</h3>
          <span class="word-count">3.2k words</span>
        </header>
        <blockquote class="excerpt">
          "No mother deserves to watch her children die," she had overheard a
          guard mentioning once, though she had not seen his face nor the coat
          of arms he bore in his chest. <em>Am I still a mother if I have no
          children left to me?</em> Catelyn wondered. <em>Is an apple tree
          still a tree after it's been carved out?</em>
        </blockquote>
        <a
          href="https://archiveofourown.org/works/72301406/chapters/188249491"
          class="sample-link"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Read on AO3 ↗
        </a>
      </article>

      <article class="sample">
        <header class="sample-header">
          <h3>There Is Love That Doesn't Have a Place to Rest</h3>
          <span class="word-count">5.6k words</span>
        </header>
        <blockquote class="excerpt">
          The sky was dark and ugly the day Balon Greyjoy was brought before
          the King to either lose his head or his pride. Thick, dark clouds
          hung above, and men firmed their feet on the wet stony ground to
          face the wind that blew from the sea. Eddard Stark, Lord of
          Winterfell, Warden of the North, looked at the water and saw his
          reflection staring back. "It won't rain, 'tis just damn ironborn
          weather," he heard someone behind him mumble, while far away, a
          lone thunder boomed.
        </blockquote>
        <a
          href="https://archiveofourown.org/works/85409191"
          class="sample-link"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Read on AO3 ↗
        </a>
      </article>

      <article class="sample">
        <header class="sample-header">
          <h3>I Wasn't Born to Stoop, to Scorn, and Knuckle Under</h3>
          <span class="word-count">260 words</span>
        </header>
        <blockquote class="excerpt">
          "I… I had no other choice."<br /><br />
          "Then tell me, girl," the darkin roars the word like a curse, and
          Xolaani can no longer hide the disgust brewing underneath it—the
          resentment, the envy that screams Xolaani herself has been a monster
          for far longer than she ever was a girl. "What choice is there for
          the starving when you place before them a plate of meat?"
        </blockquote>
        <a
          href="https://archiveofourown.org/works/83832781"
          class="sample-link"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Read on AO3 ↗
        </a>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="pricing" aria-labelledby="pricing-heading">
      <h2 id="pricing-heading">Pricing</h2>
      <ul class="tiers">
        <li class="tier">
          <h3>Flash</h3>
          <p class="price">$2 – $30</p>
          <p class="tier-range">100 to 1,500 words</p>
          <p>Between drabbles and short one-shots.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="tier">
          <h3>Medium</h3>
          <p class="price">$32 – $70</p>
          <p class="tier-range">1,600 to 3,500 words</p>
          <p>Stories with room to breathe.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="tier">
          <h3>Long</h3>
          <p class="price">$72 – $110</p>
          <p class="tier-range">3,600 to 5,500 words</p>
          <p>The full slow burn, up to 5.5k.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="add-ons" aria-labelledby="addons-heading">
      <h2 id="addons-heading">Add-Ons</h2>
      <ul class="addon-list">
        <li class="addon">
          <span class="addon-name">Erotica</span>
          <span class="addon-price">+$10</span>
        </li>
        <li class="addon">
          <span class="addon-name">Original Work</span>
          <span class="addon-price">+$10</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* Sample enhancements */
  .sample-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .sample-header h3 {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .word-count {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    background: var(--mint);
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
    padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
    box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 var(--ink);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .excerpt {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--ink);
    margin: 0 0 0.85rem 0;
    padding: 0.5rem 0 0.5rem 1rem;
    color: var(--navy);
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .sample-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--ink);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    text-decoration-color: var(--mint);
    transition: background var(--press);
  }
  .sample-link:hover {
    background: var(--mint);
  }

  /* Pricing tier extras */
  .tier-range {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    opacity: 0.8;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem !important;
  }

  /* Add-ons section */
  .add-ons {
    background: var(--paper);
    border: var(--border-w) solid var(--ink);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    padding: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .addon-list {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .addon {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    background: var(--mint);
    border: var(--border-w) solid var(--ink);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
  }
  .addon-name {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .addon-price {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--mint);
    padding: 0.15rem 0.45rem;
    border: 2px solid var(--ink);
  }
</style>
